# Source logo lives in assets/; ignore the root working copy
/VUB Logo.png
# Legacy course subrepos (archived in M3-D; tracked by their own git)
/VUB Financial Readiness Course/
/VUB Intermediate Computer Course/

# --- M3-D archive (retired copies live on disk for provenance; payload NOT tracked) ---
# Embedded repos carry their own .git; archive holds a 1.88 MB logo + HTML already
# committed canonically. Recovery = on-disk archive + freeze tag + git history.
/_archive/*
!/_archive/README.md
